A||||19||Tweek||More White face guage's||||1||
Z||000000||Tweek||06-24-2001||03:59 AM||||I decided I wanted some white face guages. I have an '84 which has an 85 mph, and the volts in the tach. I took Aus's very well done faces and edited them heavily. Thank you Aus! Apparently fierofrek and I were doing the same things tonight because he also did some. See: <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/007977.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/007977.html</A>  I also borrowed Slammed's idea for the pegasus in the speedo. To make these ones just print em on full size label sheets, and cut em out. Worked great for me, though Im sure there are better ways to do it.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.oswg.net/Ted/Speedo4.jpg">  <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.oswg.net/Ted/Speedo2.jpg">  <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.oswg.net/Ted/tempandgas.jpg">  <P>I also wanted them to be lit up green. Since they are the early reflectorized kind I painted the orange panal white to start with and them painted it flor. green. Worked really really well. Not too bright, just perfect. unfortunatly I cant show pics cause my camera doesnt work too well at night.<p>[This message has been edited by Tweek (edited 06-24-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||fierofrek||06-24-2001||05:56 AM||||You did good work! I was just bored, and a friend asked me to do it like a week ago so i did it. here ya go, put a pic of your car in the Tach LOL. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/car_white.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Tweek||06-24-2001||06:24 AM||||Thats pretty sweet... unfortunatly, my printer doesn't do well with anything photographic. I have a hard enough time with just simple graphics. Cool stuff though.||||reg||1
