Z||000005||Tweek||06-24-2001||06:44 AM||||bubble jet. It came with the puter (hp) and has always been like that. Im probably gonna reprint em somewhere else, just to make it a little better, Im gonna go tak a pic now that its light out....<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.oswg.net/Ted/Misc/dash0001.jpg">  <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.oswg.net/Ted/Misc/dash0002.jpg">  <P>Well, what do I expect for a $100 cam..  oh well, you get the general idea.<P>Now is that your dash.. or someone else's that you designed?<p>[This message has been edited by Tweek (edited 06-24-2001).]||||reg||1
