Z||000011||Tweek||06-29-2001||04:38 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by ferrari_momo:<BR><B>wow, very nice work!  got any that says ferrari with a horse made for fieros???  i am interested.<BR>ferrari_momo@yahoo.com<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Well, not right off hand, but I'm sure it would be easy to swap the pegasus for a horse and put ferrari instead of pontiac racing...  I'm also assuming that you use the oil pres. gauge and not the volts in the tach..  well, its late/early, and I have a full day tomorrow. I'll spend some time on it tomorrow eve.<P>Oh btw, I have seen "Ferrari" written commonly in 2 different styles, one with the top of the F going over the whole word and one without, which one in your opinion looks better? if you go to <A HREF="http://www.ferrari.it" TARGET=_blank>www.ferrari.it</A>  i think you can see what I mean.<p>[This message has been edited by Tweek (edited 06-29-2001).]||||reg||1
