Z||000019||Tweek||07-03-2001||10:52 AM||||Sorry Ive been away from the computer for a bit, but I whole-heartedly agree with Aus. I used his as a template. I'll still try to come up with something, though Im sure Aus could do it better, *bowing to superior graphics talent*. But I think it would be bad form to accept money for selling someones elses work, especally when they were offering it for free, even if I did edit it slightly. <P>BTW Thanks for enlighting me/us about the size problem in the other thread. That makes a lot of sense, and to think I was actually measuring the gauge and resizing the image...  lol. though it did work. Well I have to go clean my house here (or else my wife will kill me, but hopefully I'll sit down later and catch up with the rest of the forum and make that ferrari gauge if anyone still wants it.<P><BR>Cheers,<P>Ted<p>[This message has been edited by Tweek (edited 07-03-2001).]||||reg||1
